<title>USA: Warren Twp BOE, N.J., won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Warren Twp BOE, N.J., won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities Inc., said it won $5.920 million of Warren Twp. Board of Education, N.J., school bonds, with the lowest rate of 4.90, highest price of 100.0031723.</p>
</text>
